<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Paris</title>

    <style>
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html, body {
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
            color: #222;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            text-align: centeR;
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        
        nav {
            background-color: #34495e;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0.8rem;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            margin: 0 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        
        main section {
            padding: 4rem 10%;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #ccc;
        }

        /* 1️⃣ Introduction Section - Background Image */
        #intro {
            background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502602898657-3e91760cbb34?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80') no-repeat center center/cover;
            color: white;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 4px black;
        }

        #intro h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        #intro p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        /* 2️⃣ History Section - Linear Gradient */
        #history {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
        }

        #history h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        #history p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        
        #attractions {
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #a8edea, #fed6e3);
        }

        #attractions h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        #attractions ul {
            list-style: square;
            margin-left: 2rem;
        }

        #attractions li {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
        }

        
        #culture {
            background-color: #ecf0f1;
        }

        #culture h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        #culture p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        
        footer {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            main section {
                padding: 3rem 5%;
            }
            header h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 0.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    
    <header>
        <h1>Discover Paris</h1>
    </header>

    
    <nav>
        <a href="#intro">HOME</a>
        <a href="#history">History</a>
        <a href="#attractions">Attractions</a>
        <a href="#culture">Culture</a>
    </nav>

    
    <main>
        <section id="intro">
            <h2>Welcome to Paris</h2>
            <p>
                Paris, the capital city of France, is known as the "City of Light."
                It’s famous for its iconic landmarks, world-class art, romantic streets, and rich history.
            </p>
        </section>

        
        <section id="history">
            <h2>A Glimpse into History</h2>
            <p>
                Paris has a history that stretches back over 2,000 years.
                From its beginnings as a Roman settlement to its role in the French Revolution,
                Paris has always been at the center of European culture and politics.
            </p>
        </section>

        
        <section id="attractions">
            <h2>Top Attractions</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Eiffel Tower</li>
                <li>Louvre Museum</li>
                <li>Notre-Dame Cathedral</li>
                <li>Seine River Cruise</li>
                <li>Champs-Élysées</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        
        <section id="culture">
            <h2>Culture & Lifestyle</h2>
            <p>
                Paris is a hub for art, fashion, and cuisine. The city celebrates life through
                its cafés, galleries, theaters, and annual festivals. It’s a place where tradition and modernity meet.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>

   
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Discover Paris | Designed by [LOKENDRA YADAV]</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
